{"name":"Dirty Martini","hex":"#ddd0b6","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"dirty martini","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A martini cocktail with a splash of olive brine or olive juice, typically garnished with an olive."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/dirty_martini"}],"entries":[{"title":"Swan Sovereign","blocks":[{"text":"Swan Sovereign is a three piece indie pop band from Portland, Oregon. The band was founded by three singer songwriters and multi-instrumentalists Stephanie Schneiderman (drums), Lara Michell (guitar) and Christine McKinley (bass), who write all the group's songs and share the vocal duties. The band uniquely blends folk, rock, Americana, and pop to form an eclectic explosion of beautiful harmonies, sharp song writing, and heartbreaking melancholy. Their latest album, Tea and Revenge, was released in September 2006, and was produced by John Askew (FILMguerrero) and Dave Allen. Tea and Revenge was released by Pampelmoose and is the follow-up to their acclaimed self-titled debut album."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Swan_Sovereign"},{"title":"Dirty Martini (burlesque)","blocks":[{"text":"Dirty Martini is an American burlesque dancer, pin-up model and dance teacher."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/Miss_Dirty_Martini_2009_Howl_Festival_8_by_Shankbone.jpg/330px-Miss_Dirty_Martini_2009_Howl_Festival_8_by_Shankbone.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dirty_Martini_(burlesque)"},{"title":"Martini (cocktail)","blocks":[{"text":"The martini is a cocktail made with gin and vermouth, garnished with an olive, a lemon twist, or both. Over the years, the martini has become one of the best-known mixed alcoholic beverages worldwide. A common variation, the vodka martini, uses vodka instead of gin for the cocktail's base spirit."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/15-09-26-RalfR-WLC-0084.jpg/330px-15-09-26-RalfR-WLC-0084.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Martini_(cocktail)"},{"title":"Dirt","blocks":[{"text":"Dirt  is any matter considered unclean, especially when in contact with a person's clothes, skin, or possessions. In such cases, they are said to become dirty.\nCommon types of dirt include:"},{"items":["Debris: scattered pieces of waste or remains","Dust: a general powder of organic or mineral matter","Filth: foul matter such as excrement","Grime: a black, ingrained dust such as soot","Soil: the mix of clay, sand, and humus which lies on top of bedrock. The term 'soil' may be used to refer to unwanted substances or dirt that are deposited onto surfaces such as clothing."]}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/King%27s_Cross%2C_London%3B_the_Great_Dust-Heap%2C_next_to_Battle_Br_Wellcome_V0013642.jpg/330px-King%27s_Cross%2C_London%3B_the_Great_Dust-Heap%2C_next_to_Battle_Br_Wellcome_V0013642.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dirt"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/09/Miss_Dirty_Martini_Show_Musto_Party_2011_David_Shankbone_8.JPG/500px-Miss_Dirty_Martini_Show_Musto_Party_2011_David_Shankbone_8.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/09/Miss_Dirty_Martini_Show_Musto_Party_2011_David_Shankbone_8.JPG/1280px-Miss_Dirty_Martini_Show_Musto_Party_2011_David_Shankbone_8.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/09/Miss_Dirty_Martini_Show_Musto_Party_2011_David_Shankbone_8.JPG/500px-Miss_Dirty_Martini_Show_Musto_Party_2011_David_Shankbone_8.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"M